{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんこんばんは！\n新内眞衣です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"３月になってから花粉症が\n本格的に私を苦しめにやってきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝電車に乗っていても\nマスクしてる人多いよね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに私の職場は花粉症率９０％以上！笑\n最近買った大きめの空気清浄機が大活躍しています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く過ぎ去ってくれ〜〜〜〜！\n（杉）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/03/13/7432273/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"（※おやじギャグじゃないです）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【アルバム特典会】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/03/13/7432273/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大撮影会編"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遊びにきてくれたみなさん！\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうでしたかね〜？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は皆さんの持ってくるカメラに\n個性があって楽しかったです。\nスマホだった人もアプリを\n入れたりしてたのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"基本的には"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピース\nハート\nオリジナル"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"の３タイプでの撮影だったんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんなポーズしたから、\n撮った人は他の人に見せちゃ駄目だよ！\n2人の思い出*\\(^o^)/*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めてで、いろいろあたふたしましたが\n楽しかったです〜！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/03/13/7432273/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次みんなに会えるのはチェキ会かな？？\nもしくは京都の全握？？？\nそれとも乃木坂カフェ？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あなたはどれかな？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/03/13/7432273/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クルージング編"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思ってた以上に豪華で\n私たちもびっくりでした！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クルージングなんて初めてだから\n大人になった気分"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/03/13/7432273/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/03/13/7432273/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"展望デッキ綺麗だった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は松村さんとみり愛とLチーム！\nクイズが結構白熱してました笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当選した方おめでとう！\n楽しかったね〜〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/03/13/7432273/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【告知】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"月刊ザテレビジョン　発売中！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こういう取材初めてだから嬉しかったです\nテレビっ子の私は小さい時から\nこの雑誌を見てたので不思議な感じ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3/14　CD＆DLでーた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こちらも初登場！\nいろんなことインタビューして\n頂いたので良かったら\n見てください〜*\\(^o^)/*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3/27 埼玉Walker"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだ埼玉出身メンバーと\n撮影してきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/03/13/7432273/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地元大好きだから本当に嬉しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/03/13/7432273/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何もなさそうに見えるけど\n意外に観光地がたくさんあるので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非埼玉Walkerを持って\n遊びに来てくださいね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/03/13/7432273/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってか、まずは埼玉に興味を持ってくれる\nきっかけになったらいいなあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近嬉しいことがいくつかあったの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く報告したい！うずうず！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/03/13/7432273/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは今日はこの辺でおしまいです\nまた書きます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！来週の月曜日3/16\nおに魂にゲストで出ます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/03/13/7432273/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夢のNACK5デビュー！！\n若様とお邪魔するので\nお時間あったら是非聴いて下さい！"}],"source":"archive"}